&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 392px; padding-top: 4.8px; padding-bottom: 4.8px; padding-left: 9.6px; padding-right: 9.6px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="line-height: 1; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;2023年度　2,295億円（前年比＋821億円）&lt;/p&gt;
